function fetchJson(url){return fetch(url).then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw Error(`1940s 海岸精修资料读取失败 (${r.status})`);return r.json();});}
function currentPatchId(){return document.getElementById('location')?.value||document.getElementById('terrain')?.dataset.patch||'';}
function utm51(lonDeg,latDeg){const a=6378137,f=1/298.257223563,e2=f*(2-f),ep2=e2/(1-e2),k0=.9996,lon0=123*Math.PI/180,lat=latDeg*Math.PI/180,lon=lonDeg*Math.PI/180,s=Math.sin(lat),c=Math.cos(lat),t=Math.tan(lat),N=a/Math.sqrt(1-e2*s*s),T=t*t,C=ep2*c*c,A=c*(lon-lon0),e4=e2*e2,e6=e4*e2;const M=a*((1-e2/4-3*e4/64-5*e6/256)*lat-(3*e2/8+3*e4/32+45*e6/1024)*Math.sin(2*lat)+(15*e4/256+45*e6/1024)*Math.sin(4*lat)-(35*e6/3072)*Math.sin(6*lat));return[500000+k0*N*(A+(1-T+C)*A**3/6+(5-18*T+T*T+72*C-58*ep2)*A**5/120),k0*(M+N*t*(A*A/2+(5-T+9*C+4*C*C)*A**4/24+(61-58*T+T*T+600*C-330*ep2)*A**6/720))];}
function featurePolygons(geo){const out=[];for(const f of geo.features||[]){const g=f.geometry;if(!g)continue;if(g.type==='Polygon')out.push({coordinates:g.coordinates||[],properties:f.properties||{}});else if(g.type==='MultiPolygon')for(const p of g.coordinates||[])out.push({coordinates:p,properties:f.properties||{}});}return out;}
function patchBounds(contract,patch){const t=contract.source.transform,east=col=>t[2]+t[0]*(col+.5),north=row=>t[5]+t[4]*(row+.5),e0=east(patch.columnIndices[0]),e1=east(patch.columnIndices.at(-1)),n0=north(patch.rowIndices[0]),n1=north(patch.rowIndices.at(-1));return[Math.min(e0,e1),Math.min(n0,n1),Math.max(e0,e1),Math.max(n0,n1)];}
function projectedPolygon(poly){return poly.map(ring=>ring.map(([lon,lat])=>utm51(lon,lat)));}
function polygonBounds(poly){let w=Infinity,s=Infinity,e=-Infinity,n=-Infinity;for(const ring of poly)for(const p of ring){w=Math.min(w,p[0]);s=Math.min(s,p[1]);e=Math.max(e,p[0]);n=Math.max(n,p[1]);}return[w,s,e,n];}
function boxesIntersect(a,b){return !(a[2]<b[0]||a[0]>b[2]||a[3]<b[1]||a[1]>b[3]);}
function maskSize(box){const dx=Math.max(1,box[2]-box[0]),dy=Math.max(1,box[3]-box[1]);if(dx>=dy)return[MASK_MAX,Math.max(512,Math.round(MASK_MAX*dy/dx))];return[Math.max(512,Math.round(MASK_MAX*dx/dy)),MASK_MAX];}
function makeCanvas(w,h,fill='#000'){const c=document.createElement('canvas');c.width=w;c.height=h;const ctx=c.getContext('2d',{willReadFrequently:true});ctx.fillStyle=fill;ctx.fillRect(0,0,w,h);return[c,ctx];}
function drawWaterPolygons(ctx,polygons,box,w,h,fill='#fff'){ctx.fillStyle=fill;for(const item of polygons){ctx.beginPath();for(const ring of item.rings){let first=true;for(const[e,n]of ring){const x=(e-box[0])/(box[2]-box[0])*w,y=(box[3]-n)/(box[3]-box[1])*h;if(first){ctx.moveTo(x,y);first=false;}else ctx.lineTo(x,y);}ctx.closePath();}ctx.fill('evenodd');}}
function touchingEdges(poly,bounds){const[w,s,e,n]=bounds,edges=new Set();for(const ring of poly)for(const[lon,lat]of ring){if(Math.abs(lon-w)<=EDGE_EPS_DEG)edges.add('west');if(Math.abs(lon-e)<=EDGE_EPS_DEG)edges.add('east');if(Math.abs(lat-s)<=EDGE_EPS_DEG)edges.add('south');if(Math.abs(lat-n)<=EDGE_EPS_DEG)edges.add('north');}return[...edges];}
function buildProjectedControls(controls,box){const polygons=[];let sourcePolygonCount=0,pointCount=0;for(const control of controls)for(const geo of control.geos)for(const source of featurePolygons(geo)){sourcePolygonCount++;const p=projectedPolygon(source.coordinates),b=polygonBounds(p);if(!boxesIntersect(b,box))continue;for(const r of p)pointCount+=r.length;polygons.push({sheet:control.sheet,rings:p,bounds:b,touchEdges:touchingEdges(source.coordinates,control.bounds),sourcePixelArea:Number(source.properties?.pixelArea||0)});}return{polygons,sourcePolygonCount,pointCount};}
function classifyControlPolygons(polygons,base,box,w,h){const fullPixels=w*h,accepted=[],rejected=[],[candidateCanvas,candidateCtx]=makeCanvas(w,h);for(let index=0;index<polygons.length;index++){const item=polygons[index];candidateCtx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);candidateCtx.fillStyle='#000';candidateCtx.fillRect(0,0,w,h);drawWaterPolygons(candidateCtx,[item],box,w,h,'#fff');const candidate=candidateCtx.getImageData(0,0,w,h).data;let areaPixels=0,modernLandPixels=0;for(let i=0;i<candidate.length;i+=4)if(candidate[i+1]>=128){areaPixels++;if(base[i+1]>=128)modernLandPixels++;}if(!areaPixels)continue;const coverage=areaPixels/fullPixels,landFraction=modernLandPixels/areaPixels,waterSupport=1-landFraction,edgeCount=item.touchEdges.length;let reason='accepted';if(edgeCount>=2&&item.sourcePixelArea>=8000&&waterSupport<.55)reason='reject-frame-connected-weak-modern-water-support';else if(coverage>=.20&&landFraction>=.42)reason='reject-very-large-mostly-modern-land';else if(coverage>=.08&&landFraction>=.62)reason='reject-large-mostly-modern-land';else if(edgeCount>=2&&coverage>=.08&&landFraction>=.50)reason='reject-frame-connected-background';const diagnostic={index,sheet:item.sheet,areaPixels,coverage:+coverage.toFixed(5),modernLandPixels,landFraction:+landFraction.toFixed(5),modernWaterSupport:+waterSupport.toFixed(5),touchEdges:item.touchEdges,sourcePixelArea:item.sourcePixelArea,reason};if(reason==='accepted'){accepted.push(item);diagnostic.accepted=true;}else{rejected.push(diagnostic);diagnostic.accepted=false;}item.quality=diagnostic;}return{accepted,rejected,all:polygons.map(p=>p.quality).filter(Boolean)};}
function markMountainProtection(terrain,base,box,w,h){const pos=terrain.geometry?.attributes?.position;if(!pos)return{mask:new Uint8Array(w*h),seedVertices:0,protectedPixels:0};const out=new Uint8Array(w*h),sx=terrain.scale?.x??1,sy=terrain.scale?.y??1,sz=terrain.scale?.z??1,cx=(box[0]+box[2])*.5,cn=(box[1]+box[3])*.5,mpp=Math.max((box[2]-box[0])/w,(box[3]-box[1])/h),r=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(ISLAND_PROTECT_RADIUS_M/mpp));let seedVertices=0;for(let i=0;i<pos.count;i++){const height=pos.getY(i)*sy*1000;if(height<ISLAND_PROTECT_HEIGHT_M)continue;const e=cx+pos.getX(i)*sx*1000,n=cn-pos.getZ(i)*sz*1000,px=Math.round((e-box[0])/(box[2]-box[0])*(w-1)),py=Math.round((box[3]-n)/(box[3]-box[1])*(h-1));if(px<0||py<0||px>=w||py>=h)continue;seedVertices++;for(let dy=-r;dy<=r;dy++){const yy=py+dy;if(yy<0||yy>=h)continue;const maxDx=Math.floor(Math.sqrt(Math.max(0,r*r-dy*dy)));for(let dx=-maxDx;dx<=maxDx;dx++){const xx=px+dx;if(xx<0||xx>=w)continue;const p=yy*w+xx;if(base[p*4+1]>=128)out[p]=1;}}}let protectedPixels=0;for(const v of out)protectedPixels+=v;return{mask:out,seedVertices,protectedPixels};}
function forceXuanmenOpen(ctx,box,w,h){const pts=XUANMEN_CENTERLINE_WGS84.map(([lon,lat])=>utm51(lon,lat)).map(([e,n])=>[(e-box[0])/(box[2]-box[0])*w,(box[3]-n)/(box[3]-box[1])*h]);const mpp=Math.max((box[2]-box[0])/w,(box[3]-box[1])/h),lineWidth=Math.max(3,XUANMEN_WIDTH_M/mpp);ctx.save();ctx.strokeStyle='#000';ctx.lineWidth=lineWidth;ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.lineJoin='round';ctx.beginPath();pts.forEach(([x,y],i)=>i?ctx.lineTo(x,y):ctx.moveTo(x,y));ctx.stroke();ctx.restore();return{lineWidthPx:lineWidth,centerlinePoints:pts.length};}
function historicalLandAt(masks,box,x,z){const e=(box[0]+box[2])*.5+x*1000,n=(box[1]+box[3])*.5-z*1000,px=Math.floor((e-box[0])/(box[2]-box[0])*masks.width),py=Math.floor((box[3]-n)/(box[3]-box[1])*masks.height);if(px<0||py<0||px>=masks.width||py>=masks.height)return false;return masks.landPixels[(py*masks.width+px)*4+1]>=128;}
function filterOsmObject(object,masks,box){const g=object.geometry,pos=g?.attributes?.position,index=g?.index;if(!pos||!index)return{removed:0,kept:0};if(!object.userData.wenzhouMapMotherBaseIndex)object.userData.wenzhouMapMotherBaseIndex=index.array.slice();const base=object.userData.wenzhouMapMotherBaseIndex,kept=[];let removed=0;for(let k=0;k+1<base.length;k+=2){const a=Number(base[k]),b=Number(base[k+1]),ax=pos.getX(a),az=pos.getZ(a),bx=pos.getX(b),bz=pos.getZ(b),mx=(ax+bx)*.5,mz=(az+bz)*.5;if(historicalLandAt(masks,box,ax,az)&&historicalLandAt(masks,box,bx,bz)&&historicalLandAt(masks,box,mx,mz))kept.push(a,b);else removed++;}const Ctor=base.constructor;g.setIndex(new THREE.BufferAttribute(new Ctor(kept),1));object.userData.wenzhouMapMother1940sMasked=true;return{removed,kept:kept.length/2};}
function applyOsmMask(scene,masks,box){let roadHidden=0,buildingHidden=0,roadKept=0,buildingKept=0,objects=0;scene.traverse(object=>{if(!object.userData?.wenzhouOsmEvidence)return;objects++;const r=filterOsmObject(object,masks,box);if(object.userData.kind==='osm-road-centerline-evidence'){roadHidden+=r.removed;roadKept+=r.kept;}else if(object.userData.kind==='osm-building-footprint-boundary-evidence'){buildingHidden+=r.removed;buildingKept+=r.kept;}});document.getElementById('show-osm-roads')?.dispatchEvent(new Event('change'));document.getElementById('show-osm-buildings')?.dispatchEvent(new Event('change'));return{objects,roadHidden,buildingHidden,roadKept,buildingKept};}
function buildRefinedMask(terrain,projected,box){const baseTexture=terrain.userData.wenzhouMapMotherBaseAlphaMap||terrain.material?.alphaMap;if(!baseTexture?.image)throw Error('1940s 海岸精修缺少基础 land mask');terrain.userData.wenzhouMapMotherBaseAlphaMap=baseTexture;const[w,h]=maskSize(box),[baseCanvas,baseCtx]=makeCanvas(w,h),[waterCanvas,waterCtx]=makeCanvas(w,h),[landCanvas,landCtx]=makeCanvas(w,h);baseCtx.imageSmoothingEnabled=true;baseCtx.imageSmoothingQuality='high';baseCtx.drawImage(baseTexture.image,0,0,w,h);const base=baseCtx.getImageData(0,0,w,h).data,quality=classifyControlPolygons(projected.polygons,base,box,w,h);if(!quality.accepted.length)throw Error('1940s 海岸精修没有通过质量门的历史水域控制');drawWaterPolygons(waterCtx,quality.accepted,box,w,h,'#fff');landCtx.imageSmoothingEnabled=true;landCtx.imageSmoothingQuality='high';landCtx.drawImage(baseCanvas,0,0,w,h);drawWaterPolygons(landCtx,quality.accepted,box,w,h,'#000');let land=landCtx.getImageData(0,0,w,h),data=land.data,protection=markMountainProtection(terrain,base,box,w,h),islandRestoredPixels=0;for(let p=0;p<protection.mask.length;p++)if(protection.mask[p]){const i=p*4;if(base[i+1]>=128&&data[i+1]<128){data[i]=data[i+1]=data[i+2]=255;data[i+3]=255;islandRestoredPixels++;}}landCtx.putImageData(land,0,0);const beforeXuanmen=landCtx.getImageData(0,0,w,h).data,xuanmen=forceXuanmenOpen(landCtx,box,w,h),after=landCtx.getImageData(0,0,w,h),afterData=after.data;let xuanmenForcedWaterPixels=0,historicalWaterPixels=0,reclaimedPixels=0,currentLandPixels=0;for(let i=0;i<afterData.length;i+=4){if(base[i+1]>=128)currentLandPixels++;if(afterData[i+1]<128){historicalWaterPixels++;if(base[i+1]>=128)reclaimedPixels++;if(beforeXuanmen[i+1]>=128)xuanmenForcedWaterPixels++;}}const texture=new THREE.CanvasTexture(landCanvas);texture.minFilter=THREE.LinearMipmapLinearFilter;texture.magFilter=THREE.LinearFilter;texture.generateMipmaps=true;texture.anisotropy=4;texture.needsUpdate=true;texture.userData={wenzhouMapMother:true,epoch:'1940s',kind:'refined-land-water-mask-v2'};return{texture,landPixels:afterData,width:w,height:h,historicalWaterPixels,reclaimedPixels,currentLandPixels,acceptedControlPolygons:quality.accepted.length,rejectedControlPolygons:quality.rejected.length,rejectedControls:quality.rejected,islandProtectionSeedVertices:protection.seedVertices,islandProtectionPixels:protection.protectedPixels,islandRestoredPixels,xuanmenForcedWaterPixels,xuanmen};}
function applyRefinedMask(scene,terrain,masks){const old=terrain.userData.wenzhouMapMotherRefinedAlphaMap;if(old&&old!==masks.texture)old.dispose?.();terrain.userData.wenzhouMapMotherRefinedAlphaMap=masks.texture;terrain.material.alphaMap=masks.texture;terrain.material.alphaTest=.35;terrain.material.alphaToCoverage=true;terrain.material.needsUpdate=true;let seaUpdated=false;scene.traverse(object=>{if(object.userData?.wenzhouSeaDemo&&object.material?.uniforms?.uLandMask){object.material.uniforms.uLandMask.value=masks.texture;object.material.needsUpdate=true;seaUpdated=true;}});return seaUpdated;}
function publishOsmMetrics(osm,state){const c=document.getElementById('terrain');if(c){c.dataset.history1940sOsmObjects=String(osm.objects);c.dataset.history1940sRoadSegmentsHiddenWater=String(osm.roadHidden);c.dataset.history1940sBuildingSegmentsHiddenWater=String(osm.buildingHidden);}if(state)state.osmHistoricalWaterMask=osm;}

export function installHistory1942CoastRefinement(){
  if(window[FLAG])return;window[FLAG]=true;const contractPromise=fetchJson(TERRAIN_URL),controlPromise=Promise.all(CONTROLS.map(async c=>({...c,geos:await Promise.all(c.urls.map(fetchJson))})));let latest=null,activeRefined=null,token=0;
  window.addEventListener('wenzhou:terrain-added',event=>{const d=event.detail||{};if(d.scene?.isScene&&d.terrain?.isMesh&&d.patchId)latest=d;});
  window.addEventListener('wenzhou:map-mother-1940s-ready',async event=>{const patchId=event.detail?.patchId;if(!latest||latest.patchId!==patchId||currentPatchId()!==patchId)return;const local=++token,canvas=document.getElementById('terrain');try{const[contract,controls]=await Promise.all([contractPromise,controlPromise]);if(local!==token||currentPatchId()!==patchId)return;const patch=contract.patches.find(p=>p.id===patchId);if(!patch)throw Error(`1940s 海岸精修缺少 patch ${patchId}`);const box=patchBounds(contract,patch),projected=buildProjectedControls(controls,box),masks=buildRefinedMask(latest.terrain,projected,box);if(local!==token||currentPatchId()!==patchId){masks.texture.dispose();return;}const seaUpdated=applyRefinedMask(latest.scene,latest.terrain,masks),state=window.__wenzhouMapMother1940s||{};Object.assign(state,{schema:'wenzhou-map-mother/1940s-land-water-delta-v2',coastRefinement:'highres-linear-island-protected-xuanmen-open',maskWidth:masks.width,maskHeight:masks.height,historicalWaterPixels:masks.historicalWaterPixels,reclaimedPixels:masks.reclaimedPixels,acceptedControlPolygons:masks.acceptedControlPolygons,rejectedControlPolygons:masks.rejectedControlPolygons,rejectedControls:masks.rejectedControls,islandProtectionHeightM:ISLAND_PROTECT_HEIGHT_M,islandProtectionRadiusM:ISLAND_PROTECT_RADIUS_M,islandProtectionSeedVertices:masks.islandProtectionSeedVertices,islandProtectionPixels:masks.islandProtectionPixels,islandRestoredPixels:masks.islandRestoredPixels,xuanmenConnectivity:'forced-open-derived-topology',xuanmenCorridorWidthM:XUANMEN_WIDTH_M,xuanmenForcedWaterPixels:masks.xuanmenForcedWaterPixels,seaMaskUpdated:seaUpdated,storage:'runtime-derived-vector-plus-procedural-protection-no-epoch-dem-copy'});window.__wenzhouMapMother1940s=state;activeRefined={scene:latest.scene,masks,box,patchId,state};const osm=applyOsmMask(latest.scene,masks,box);publishOsmMetrics(osm,state);if(canvas){canvas.dataset.history1940sRefined='true';canvas.dataset.history1940sMaskWidth=String(masks.width);canvas.dataset.history1940sMaskHeight=String(masks.height);canvas.dataset.history1940sHistoricalWaterPixels=String(masks.historicalWaterPixels);canvas.dataset.history1940sReclaimedPixels=String(masks.reclaimedPixels);canvas.dataset.history1940sAcceptedControlPolygons=String(masks.acceptedControlPolygons);canvas.dataset.history1940sRejectedControlPolygons=String(masks.rejectedControlPolygons);canvas.dataset.history1940sIslandRestoredPixels=String(masks.islandRestoredPixels);canvas.dataset.history1940sXuanmenForcedWaterPixels=String(masks.xuanmenForcedWaterPixels);canvas.dataset.history1940sXuanmenConnectivity='open';canvas.dataset.history1940sSeaMaskUpdated=String(seaUpdated);canvas.dataset.history1940sRefinementError='';}const card=document.getElementById('history-1942-card');if(card){const strong=card.querySelector('strong'),span=card.querySelector('span'),small=card.querySelector('small');if(strong)strong.textContent='1940s Map Mother · 海岸精修 V2';if(span)span.textContent=`海岸 ${masks.width}×${masks.height} · 山体岛恢复 ${masks.islandRestoredPixels.toLocaleString()} px · 玄门通道强制贯通`;if(small)small.textContent='历史围垦继续回退；高程山体作为岛屿保护层，避免被粗历史水域误削。玄门湾按 1940s 连通拓扑处理，精确岸线等待更细历史图覆盖。';}window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('wenzhou:map-mother-1940s-refined',{detail:state}));}catch(error){if(canvas)canvas.dataset.history1940sRefinementError=String(error.message||error);console.error(error);}});
  const c=document.getElementById('terrain');if(c)new MutationObserver(()=>{if(!activeRefined)return;if(c.dataset.osmLoaded==='true'&&c.dataset.osmPatch===activeRefined.patchId){const osm=applyOsmMask(activeRefined.scene,activeRefined.masks,activeRefined.box);publishOsmMetrics(osm,activeRefined.state);}}).observe(c,{attributes:true,attributeFilter:['data-osm-loaded','data-osm-patch']});
}
